{"version":1,"content":"<p>藝人張振朗與劉穎鏇（Tiffany）今晚（19日）出席台慶，Tiffany由於早前在電台籃球賽表現出息，因而有「三分鏇」的新封號，經常與對方組隊打籃球的振朗親自認證，並盛讚對方好犀利：「試過一場波入6球3分，仲要同男仔打，拎埋MVP。</p><p>」Ti</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T12:57:35.281931+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T12:21:50+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T12:50:50.707163+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T12:50:50.707163+00:00","content_hash":"4a275e98562039b7110c8e1f64da88aca458fa8d8ca43140460c5f79fed5054b","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}